window.products.push({"id":97011,"name":"6600JB1010A Refrigerator Door Switch Replacement for Kenmore PS3529268 6600JB1010K 6600JB1004A AP4442090 Ultra Durable Part 795.76203901 795.76202901 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5155kyj63RS._SL1500_.jpg","description":"💡 Refrigerator Door Switch 6600jb1010a - A high-quality exact equivalent for part numbers AP4442090, 6600JB1010K, 1268243, 6600JB1004A, 6600JB1010L, 6600JB1010M, AH3529268, EA3529268, PS3529268. Ultra Durable 6600jb1010a Switch is compatible with LG and Kenmore refrigerators. The 6600jb1010a Switch is made from high-quality materials, and it is designed to be durable and long-lasting. It fits hundreds of models and can be installed in a few minutes. Wear gloves before the repair process. 🔧 DIY eTips Included - Not sure how to replace the Part 6600jb1010a? Helpful information can be found on the page below. Scroll down to get more repair tips. Acquire valuable skills during the DIY repair project. Refrigerator Light Switch 6600jb1010a will help if your appliance light is not working. Kenmore 6600jb1010a Switch helps to conserve energy and extend the life of the light bulb. You'll need a flat-blade screwdriver and needle-nose pliers for this 15-mins replacement. 💡 Lg 6600jb1010a Door Switch that controls the interior light in your refrigerator is a type of switch that is usually closed, and it activates when the door is opened and closed. This means that when the button is pushed, there should be no connection, and when it is released, the switch should make a connection. 6600jb1010a Refrigerator Door Push Button Switch meets or exceeds all manufacturer specifications. We provide a lifetime warranty and guarantee 100% money back. 💡 Are the refrigerators door switches universal? Refrigerator door switches are not universal and can vary in their design, specifications, and compatibility with different refrigerator models. Different manufacturers and models may use different types of door switches that are not interchangeable. This 6600jb1010a Switch may be compatible with several different LG and Kenmore refrigerator models, but it may not be compatible with other brands or models of refrigerators. 💡 How long does a door switch typically last before needing to be replaced? The lifespan of a door switch can vary depending on usage and environmental factors. However, on average, a door switch can last for several years before needing to be replaced. If the door switch is used frequently or if it is exposed to high levels of moisture or humidity, it may wear out more quickly. Additionally, if the switch is damaged or exposed to extreme temperatures, it may fail sooner than expected.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5155kyj63RS._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PartsBroz","source_asin":"B07VV4RDQT","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-97011","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VV4RDQT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VV4RDQT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
