window.products.push({"id":97048,"name":"Upstreman X90 Countertop Nugget Ice Maker | Max 33Lbs/Day | Self-Cleaning Pebble Ice Maker Machine | Stainless Steel Housing | Fit Under Wall Cabinet ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":339.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61accTTzAgL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Chewable Nugget Ice】The opal ice actually made by compressing ice flakes into perfectly chewy little nuggets, making you enjoy chewing without hurting the teeth. It can perfectly retain the drink flavor, cooling tropical and tiki cocktails, soda, blended drinks, and juice faster than traditional ice cubes. 【Easy to Use】It only features two touch buttons on/off and self-cleaning functions. Effective Self-Cleaning Cycles- Press and hold the button for 3 seconds for water circulation to defrost and deodorize. In order to prolong the service life of the ice maker, so cleaning it once a week is important. 【Quiet & Energy-saving】The nugget ice maker X90 with upgrade ice-making technology and a silent exhaust fan that makes minimum noises of 46dB during operation, similar to a working refrigerator. The energy cost is estimated to be as low as 4.08 kWh per day causes equipped with a smart IC chip. 【Fast Ice Making】Never run out of nugget ice thanks to the ability to produce 33 lbs of ice in a day, and has a storage container that can hold 3.6 lbs, this is a great choice for meeting your family’s daily needs or providing ice for a get-together. 【High-Quality Pebble ice】Do not use liquids other than pure water, such as cola, alcohol, and other beverages to make ice. The higher the water temperature, the slower the ice-making rate. NOTE: It is strongly recommended to use water with TDS< 50 ppm for ice making. High TDS will cause the ice squeezer to freeze and cause noise due to friction with the ice scraper.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61accTTzAgL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Upstreman","source_asin":"B0C5X3WG95","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-97048","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5X3WG95","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5X3WG95","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
