window.products.push({"id":97141,"name":"Upgraded MP22YA 4 Pack Electric Range Burner Element Unit Set, 2 x MP15YA 6\" and 2 x MP21YA 8\" Stove Burners Replacement for Kenmore, Hardwick, Maytag","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FKQy7-aaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【High Quality & Upgraded Material Stove Burner】 The MP22YA electric stove burners replacement set are made from high temperature stainless alloys.durable to use, small temperature coefficient of resistance, low deformation at high temperature and not easy to embrittle. Fits OEM Standards and/or exceed OEM requirements by tested. 【Electric Stove Burners Elements For Whirlpool Compatibility】 These stove top burners element fit most ranges, EXEPT GE/Hotpoint. Replace part number: 484782, 9761347, 12001231, S46Y15, 5304431014, 484783, SU204, 04000034, 0045546, 0051088, 0054794, 0067069, 0071930, 3374, AP3075808, PS340571, EAP340571. If you are not sure whether the product is compatible with your stove, please feel free to contact us, we will help you confirm it. 【Design】 It has a \"Y\" style bracket. This burner elements will not fit GE and Hotpoint, and make sure your Y bracket size match ours，otherwise this product may not fit your drip pans. If the range burner does not sit flat on your stove, make sure the connection bolts are parallel and pushed a bit down. Please check the dimensions of the stove burner as shown on the photos to ensure they fit your stove before purchasing. 【Package List】 We have a 100% money back guarantee on our products. If the product is defective or damaged, WE WILL RESEND THE NEW FOR YOU OR REFUND YOUR MONEY. The stove burners replacement electric set include 2pcs MP15YA Stove Burner Element-6\" 1500 watt 230v 4 coils and 2pcs MP21YA Stove Burner Element -8\" 2100 watt 230v 5 coils. 【Reminder】The new stove burner has a layer of protect coating on it, which is used to protect the surface. When using the item for the first time, the protect coating will volatilize with the high temperature, it maybe has a little smog, which is normal because it is caused by the protective layer of the new burner element. Customer continue to use the product for about 20 minutes, and there will be no more smoke when next time use. MP15YA specs include 6\" 4 coils, MP21YA include 8\" 5 coils.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FKQy7-aaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LXun","source_asin":"B08BLJYTD4","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-97141","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BLJYTD4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BLJYTD4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
