window.products.push({"id":97267,"name":"LiquaGen 1 Cubic Foot - Coconut Carbon Media Whole House Systems | Contaminant Remover | Highly Porous Activated Charcoal Bulk for Whole Home Water Pu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":139.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41OBQwO3KeL._AC_.jpg","description":"ELIMINATE CONTAMINANTS: Carbon removes bad taste and more importantly, dangerous contaminants from water, wastewater & processed liquids, that compromise human health. Some of the key contaminants removed by filtering water over solid charcoal carbon water filters are: taste and odor compounds, organic color, total organic carbon (TOC) and negative industrial fluids such as chlorinated solvents (PCE, TCE). HIGH ADSORPTION: Activated Charcoal Media is made in controlled settings via high temperature steam activation. Its porous nature deems it perfect for adsorption of both large and small molecule weight impurities from water and other liquids. It is very useful for adsorbing trace VOC's. BENEFITS: Whole House water filter with a strong adsorbing charcoal deodorizer pore structure optimal for the treatment of chlorine and other VOC's. The coconut charcoal mitigates hardness & the charcoal pellets reduce abrasion resistance required for thermal reactivation and minimizing fines when operations backwashing is required. Activated charcoal powder provides a wide range of contaminant removal capabilities. FEATURES: Coconut shell carbon, high mechanical strength, good for the ecosystem, low ash, far more effective than regular grade activated carbon, To Treat Residential or Commercial Water devices. APPLICATIONS: This mesh bag with activated charcoal odor absorber can be used in a variety of water applications for the removal of dissolved organic compounds. It can be used in applications such as process water purification, water softener filtration, wastewater treatment, industrial purification & many more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41OBQwO3KeL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LiquaGen","source_asin":"B00RP80SX4","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-97267","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00RP80SX4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B00RP80SX4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
