window.products.push({"id":97296,"name":"Heavy-Duty Aluminum 24x24x2 Baffle Hood Filter By Trophy Air - UL Certified - Made in USA - Durable & Cost-Effective, Improved Airflow, Dishwasher-Saf","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":48.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yfUED7DHL._AC_SL1186_.jpg","description":"Here’s The #1 Heavy-Duty & Convenient Baffle Filter For Every Modern Kitchen! Sick and tired of constantly replacing your mesh filters? Need a reliable, durable and ergonomic baffle filter to save your effort and money? Introducing The Ultimate Aluminum Baffle Grease Filter By Trophy Filter! It’s to finally invest in a practical and sturdy, professional-grade baffle filter for your home or restaurant kitchen and leave all those cheaply-made mesh grease filters behind you once and for all! The robust construction and hassle-free design of our premium grease filter will help you spend less time cleaning and more time enjoying your delicious meals! Here’s How It Works: Our aerodynamically designed baffle filter will force grease-saturated air through a series of compressions, expansions and pressure changes until the heavier grease droplets are trapped on the metal blades and drained into the filter tray. It’s that simple! And due to this innovative design, your filter will have improved airflow and will not require constant cleaning. The Mom-Approved Baffle Filter Is Here To Make Your Life Easier! Since our baffle grease filter is made of heavy-duty aluminum, all you have to do is slip it in your dishwasher and press the button. Voila! Your baffle filter will be squeaky clean effortlessly! A Safe Choice For Every Educated Family! Did you know that baffle filters are safer in case a fire breaks out? The grease traps will help prevent flames from spreading and keep your kitchen safe! What Are You Waiting For? Indulge Yourself! Click “Add To Cart” While Supplies Last!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yfUED7DHL._AC_SL1186_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trophy Air","source_asin":"B07HRXBTFH","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-97296","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HRXBTFH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HRXBTFH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
