window.products.push({"id":97614,"name":"Inoxia ALPHA Genuine Stainless Steel Kitchen Backsplash - Quick Installation with Powerful Adhesive - Molding Included - 30 Inch Wide with Adjustable ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":239.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51rzPplHcdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"About Inoxia – Wall Decorative Products Design The Inoxia brand was first introduced in Canada in 2010, and in the United States in 2016. The Inoxia have been designed with the purpose of allowing anyone to undertake a renovation project, better known as Do It Yourself . Whether your project is a major one or not, our products are the ideal choice in order to achieve a result that is both professional and stylish at a lower cost! Inoxia have been recognized for easy and quick installation. Wide Range of Designs to Match Your Aesthetics We have a huge range of stainless steel backsplash to choose from, including Pluton, Venus, Mercury, Gamma, Urbania, Omega, Dosseret Alpha, Delta, Genesis. Metal backsplashes include Range backsplash Linox S2, Range backsplash Hexagonia SB, and range Backsplash Hexagonia S2. Visit our store to check out the full range of our backsplashes. Protective Makeover for Your Kitchen The Dosseret Alpha Backsplash works great to protect your Kitchen walls from harmful grease and oil. It keeps the area behind the stove looking new and clean from cooking splatters. Bring a shine to your kitchen with this high-quality stainless-steel backsplash! Minimal Maintenance Required A stainless backsplash is a striking complement to Modern Appliances. With the key feature of fast installation, it is also very durable and easy to clean. Add a few drops of dish detergent to a bucket of warm to hot water and use a soft cloth with soapy water to clean your backsplash. Install our Dosseret Alpha backsplash behind your range for a sharp look and easy cleaning. ✅ Stainless steel material speaks for durability ✅ Dimensions: 30” Wide x Adjustable Height (24”–30”) Tired of repeated cleaning? PROTECT your walls from cooking spills with our easy-to-clean backsplashes! Add to Cart NOW!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51rzPplHcdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Inoxia","source_asin":"B09K8K4FJM","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-97614","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09K8K4FJM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09K8K4FJM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
