window.products.push({"id":97648,"name":"Pour Over Coffee Dripper / Maker - Stainless Steel with Clever Cone Design - Reusable / Washable Paperless Filter with Stand and Free Scoop - CaffeVER","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41+yId1f0sL._AC_.jpg","description":"Stainless Steel Pour Over Coffee Dripper Do you want a professionally made cup of coffee without the high-prices and long wait times? Are you tired of buying expensive and oversized coffee dripper machines just to find out you would rather pay for a cup of coffee than wash the equipment? Allow us to present you with your solution: The CaffeVERO Stainless Steel Coffee Dripper PERFECT DRIP FOR THE PERFECT SIP - Our clever coffee dripper features dual filtration and offers you features a paper filter cannot. The ultra fine coffee filter and mesh combination will never over filter and leave out the flavors you desire from your coffee. You will have an excellent cup of coffee with increased higher notes every single time! PROFESSIONAL DESIGN FOR PROFESSIONAL RESULTS - Not only did we design this product to bring you coffee shop flavors, we used kitchen/food grade 18/8 stainless steel that compares to the durability of real-world coffee shop equipment. 100% BPA and chemical free. No cheap plastics and the handle never gets too hot to touch. The coffee filter set is self standing and features a non-slip silicon grip around the bottom to prevent sharp edges and accidental slippage. You will fall in love with the experience of pouring your perfect cup of coffee! UNIVERSAL FIT - We have successfully used our coffee dripper stand on cups, mugs, pots, thermoses, and carafes. It will fit on most common sized drinkware. It works in the kitchen, living room, office, backyard… ANYWHERE you can get hot water. Sized to pour one to four cups. Invite your friends and family any time! Includes a FREE premium stainless steel scoop for convenience! 100% MONEY BACK GUARANTEE We guarantee hario coffee dripper will bring you a satisfying cup of coffee with a pleasant experience of making it. If you are not satisfied with your order, simply send it back for a 100% refund! FREE shipping for prime members.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41+yId1f0sL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CaffeVERO","source_asin":"B01ENI8KPQ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-97648","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01ENI8KPQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B01ENI8KPQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
