window.products.push({"id":97676,"name":"AOAUTO 24W Mini Portable Washing Machine Ultrasonic Turbo Washer for Travel Business Trip and College Room, 3 In 1 Portable Washing Machine with USB","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gyN6jKy4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Newly Upgraded 24W Power】 Compared with other portable washing machines with power less than 10W, our 24W washing machine has stronger power and better washing effect. High-frequency vibration cavitation accelerates the dispersion and emulsification of liquid and stains to achieve the purpose of cleaning. Therefore, this mini washer is very suitable for cleaning masks and can effectively sterilize and disinfect. 【Ultrasonic Washing Machine】The washing machine will emit vibration waves to clean clothes, effectively remove dirt and make your clothes clean. Adopt low noise design, don't worry about disturbing your rest or sleep. Suitable for light and small clothes, such as underwear, socks, thin shirts, pet clothes, etc. It can also be a mini in sink dishwasher to help you stay away from detergent and protect your hands. 【4-Level Adjustment】There are 4 modes to choose from, and you can use the remote control to switch modes. Mode A: Turbine, Vibration and Bubble circulation cleaning; Mode B: Turbine Positive Inversion; Mode C: Ultrasonic Vibration cleaning ; Mode D: Bubble cleaning. The cleaning time of each mode is about 30 minutes, and the clothes are cleaned more thoroughly. Rub clothes carefully like hands, and the clothes will not be hurt. 【Easy To Use】 USB power supply, we are equipped with a plug. After running for 30 minutes, the travel washing machine will automatically shut down. After 3 minutes, you need to reconnect the USB plug before restarting the washing machine. The suction cup at the bottom allows you to install it in buckets, washbasins, sinks,etc. Note: Please install the suction cup at the bottom of the basin or barrel, not on the curved surface. 【Easy to Carry】11cm /4.3 inches in diameter and 440g/0.96lb in weight.This portable mini washer is light weight and compact. Great for travel or small batches of laundry. If you have any problems during use, please contact us, we will give you a 100% satisfactory solution, and we have a 30-day money-back guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gyN6jKy4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AOAUTO","source_asin":"B0B319L9F1","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-97676","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B319L9F1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B319L9F1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
