window.products.push({"id":97953,"name":"Dishwasher Universal Prong Rack Caps by Beaquicy - Replacement for Most Dishwasher Rack - 200 Pieces 1 Inch Long","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cUhQjcCcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PVC ✅【200PCS DISHWASHER PRONG RACK CAPS】: The Dishwasher Rack Tine Prong Repair End Cover Caps is white and has a length of 0.64 inches, the lid opening has an inner diameter of 0.11 inches, and the lid opening has an outer diameter of 0.19 inches.It can be easily form an irregular tubular shape.The dishwasher rack cover set contains 200 covers, the set contains a large number of products to meet your needs and allow you to replace them regularly. ✅【RUST PREVENTION】: Dishwasher rack fork repair end caps is suitable for dishwasher tines, dishwasher tips for dishwasher racks, thread protectors, cap screws or other threaded parts, etc.The Lids fit tightly to the tips of the racks and don’t allow water to penetrate to help prevent rust and scratches on the racks, keep the dishwasher clean, and reduce rack replacement costs.Can be used after the dishwasher rack has rusted so the rack won't rust further while protecting the dishes from damage. ✅【30 DAYS WARRANTY】: Dishwasher Rack Fork Restoration End Caps supports 30 days RETURN and EXCHANGE. Our company attaches great importance to the shopping experience of each customer. Risk-free shopping,if you have any quality problem during warranty period, please contact customer service in time. We will try our best to solve the problem. Customer satisfaction is our tireless pursuit. ✅【HIGH QUALITY PVC MATERIAL】: Dishwasher prong cap is made of high quality PVC material for excellent durability and firmness, that can withstand high temperatures up to 315 degrees Celsius (600 degrees Fahrenheit).You can use this cover if you need to: ★prevent rust on new dishwasher racks;★prevent dishes from colliding with the racks;★ prevent dishwasher rust from getting worse. ✅【BRING CONVENIENCE FOR YOUR LIFE】: The installation of dishwasher rack caps is simple.You'll need a pair of work gloves so you don't hurt your hands when you put the cover on. Please clean the rust before installation. If installation is difficult, use cooking oil to wipe the tip of the shelf, or heat the lid with hot air of a hair dryer to make the lid soft. You can also soak it in hot water so it can easily slide onto the dishwasher rack.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cUhQjcCcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B08GC6C8PN","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-97953","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GC6C8PN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GC6C8PN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
