window.products.push({"id":97984,"name":"iPartPlusMore Reusable Coffee Filters Compatible with 1.0 and 2.0 Keurig Single Cup Coffee Maker - BPA-Free Stainless Steel Refillable K Cup Coffee Fi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51sBRzWJCUL._AC_.jpg","description":"ECO-ALTERNATIVE COFFEE FILTERS: Save up to 80% over pre-filled single-serve capsules and avoid the waste of disposing of non-recyclable K Cup pods. You can help reduce your carbon footprint while enjoying your favorite coffee brewed using these reusable coffee filters with your Keurig coffee maker. PREMIUM QUALITY: Made from BPA-free, high-grade stainless steel materials, our k cup filters offer a safe way to make your own tea or coffee blend. Each reusable coffee filter is engineered with a refillable wire mesh to ensure it keeps out all the grounds to get the purest brew possible during the multi-level extraction process. EASY TO USE: Filling your own coffee capsule has never been easier with single cup Keurig coffee filters. These do not require swapping out the filter holder to fit seamlessly into every Keurig or any other brewer, just pop it into your machine, fill it with your choice of K-Cup compatible ground coffee, and let the single-serve coffee maker do the rest. CUSTOMIZE YOUR BREW: The fine mesh screen of our Keurig coffee filter increases the extraction time which makes your coffee’s flavor profile richer, stronger and flavorful. Unlike capsule cups that are designed for single-use with pre-packed coffee grounds, this reusable k cups filter gives you the option to select the ground coffee of your choice to achieve the taste you want. WIDE COMPATIBILITY: Made especially for your Keurig, iPartPlusMore reusable coffee filters are compatible with a wide variety of Keurig single-cup brewers except for K-Mini, K-Supreme, K-Duo, K-Compact, GE or LG Refrigerators, K-400, and K-155. Excellent gift for eco-conscious tea and coffee lovers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51sBRzWJCUL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iPartsPlusMore","source_asin":"B07RNJY499","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-97984","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RNJY499","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RNJY499","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
